  "updated": "2026-11-04",
  "verify": "Platform limits change often. These were researched on 2026-11-04 (sources per entry); check the platform's own help page before relying on a value near its edge. Meta and TikTok safe zones come from third-party readings of their templates.",
  "fields": "w/h: canvas px (digital); w_mm/h_mm trim size (print). safe_zone: px kept clear of platform UI or crops on each edge at w x h; null = no platform chrome, keep the class margin. safe_mm: print safe margin inside trim (safe_mm_bottom overrides the bottom). bleed_mm per side. exclusion: extra [x,y,w,h] fractions to keep clear (timestamps, avatars). max_kb: file-size cap or null. class picks the text floors and word budget in `rules`.",
